{"id":"wb-7-1426","name":"汉中东塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"汉中东塔","text":"汉中东塔位于陕西省汉中市汉台区东关东塔小学院内（原为净明寺故址），1957年被列为第二批陕西省文物保护单位，2013年被列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。\n汉中东塔形制似唐代古塔，1953年维修时在塔顶发现铁狮子一对，上铸有“庆元四年洋州城西街李子照谨舍”，说明该塔的建造年代不晚于南宋庆元四年（1198年）。东塔为方形单层密檐式砖塔，高15米，原为十三层，1953年维修时去除已坍塌的最上两层，改为十一层。底层高4.37米，宽3.3米。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B1%89%E4%B8%AD%E4%B8%9C%E5%A1%94","revisionId":86801223,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86801223","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/eb12a26d0fbcead96eb77698.jpg","title":"Dongta,_Hanzhong.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Dongta,_Hanzhong.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3f/Dongta%2C_Hanzhong.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Tyen-Shyang Chyu","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​汉中净明寺东塔","width":320,"height":427}}